WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,580
Brother, my situation is a bit serious

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:05,100
I may not be able to return to the store in the next few days.

3
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:06,840
Is the surgery fee enough?

4
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:09,120
Enough. Grandma and I made a lot of mistakes before.

5
00:00:09,360 --> 00:00:11,200
OK, tell me before you give evidence.

6
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:19,090
Dashan Brothers

7
00:00:19,290 --> 00:00:21,090
A loan of 200,000 yuan has been arranged for you

8
00:00:21,410 --> 00:00:22,770
Come directly to go through the formalities in the afternoon

9
00:00:23,090 --> 00:00:24,260
Stay for two years

10
00:00:24,620 --> 00:00:35,140
Hello, what should I pay?

11
00:00:36,150 --> 00:00:38,070
Today’s check-up and medication bills?

12
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:40,140
There are still 300,000 in the patient's account.

13
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:42,220
Even after the surgery
